WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.320
Honestly, I think the biggest 
challenge isn't the model.

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.720
It's that most of us have been taught
 for years that there's only one path:

3
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:11.120
Save a deposit, 
get a mortgage, buy a house.

4
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.200
So when something different comes along, 
it's natural to be skeptical.

5
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.120
There isn't a hidden catch, though.

6
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.680
It's simply a third option.

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.640
For some people, 
renting is exactly what they need,

8
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.240
and for some, traditional 
ownership makes perfect sense.

9
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.760
But for others,
having a home and building wealth

10
00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.160
without a deposit or a mortgage
 might be the better fit.